      "file": "../../../src/weather_forecast_audit/challenger.py",
      "oracle": "real",
      "expect": "survived",
      "why": "The features of a group's latest pair need its last 7 pairs (kept unconditionally by among_last) and the pairs in (end - 30 d, end]; within_horizon keeps window_end >= latest - R, a superset of that window for any R >= 30, so 30 days is exactly sufficient and the 10-day margin of 40 is slack. Inert for every query at or after the group's latest close, which is the only region the evaluator's contract produces (a query earlier than the latest retained pair is outside that contract: lag_n30 is then counted over the trimmed history and can undercount, for any retention below the query's age).",
